<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-012" chapter-id="c-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize" source-id="s-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize-ws2060595">
  <p id="c-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">廢帝<persName id="c-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize:p001:m0002" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAEB">王皇后</persName>，琅邪臨沂人也。天嘉元年，為皇太子妃。廢帝即位，立為皇后。廢帝為臨海王，后廢為妃。至德中薨。后生臨海嗣王<persName id="c-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize:p001:m0057" ref="2mj_6rl_6xs_A">至澤</persName>。<persName id="c-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize:p001:m0060" ref="2mj_6rl_6xs_A">至澤</persName>，光大元年為皇太子，太建元年，襲封臨海嗣王。陳亡，入長安。后父<persName id="c-nanshi-012-chen-wang-empress-and-zhize:p001:m0093" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAE">固</persName>自有傳。</p>
</text>
